# Entries here have the form:
# ID<TAB>fuel_millis
# [<TAB>result<TAB>ID]
#
# The value here is for the number of milliseconds the item can fuel a furnace, 0 if it cannot fuel it.  Missing entries
# are assumed to be 0.
# The "result" sub-record is optional and provides the item ID of an item which is generated in the station output when
# this fuel item is consumed.
# Note that the ID references are against item_registry.tablist but must appear in block_aspect.tablist to have meaning.

op.sapling	500
op.stick	500
op.ladder	1000
op.plank	1000
op.bed	2000
op.log	2000
op.crafting_table	2000
op.gate	2000
op.door	2000
op.chest	2000
op.charcoal	8000
op.coal_ore	8000
op.coal	8000
op.wood_plank_slab	500
op.wood_plank_stair	1000
op.bucket_lava	32000
	result	op.bucket_empty
